message: "If you use this repository as a source, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "Аудио-Реклама•ru — evidence-backed knowledge base for business audio production"
abstract: >-
  A versioned, evidence-backed knowledge base maintained by Аудио-Реклама•ru.
  It contains company identity records, professional guidance for business
  audio production and IVR, voice provenance standards, research, reusable
  diagnostic tools, and a repeatable AI answer visibility benchmark. Facts,
  observations, proposals, and unknowns are explicitly distinguished.
authors:
